{"title":"Mammoth Bull","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 53 Mammoth that attacks with crush (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (2.5% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 5× XP and 5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>53</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>169</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>34</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>60</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull?lv=53\" title=\"Pick level 53\"><td><b>53</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>53</td><td>in the wilds around 430, -842</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>54</b></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td>169</td><td>in the wilds around 428, -850</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull?lv=58\" title=\"Pick level 58\"><td><b>58</b></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>34</td><td>in the wilds around 363, -1065</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>60</td><td>in the wilds around 366, -1066</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"mammoth-bull\" data-map-level=\"54\">Show level 54 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 13 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 26 recorded drops, 1,901 total, 31–181 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×31–181</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mammoth-ivory\" title=\"Mammoth Ivory - in 5 of 13 looted corpses, 5 recorded drops, 5 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/5b5ea269b02209827643.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mammoth Ivory</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 3 of 13 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/